              "title": "Describing My Weekly Routine",
              "weight": 9,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700007009000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"tT7uU8vV9w\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Now let's put it all together! Here is how to describe a <b>weekly schedule</b>:\"}},{\"id\":\"wW0xX1yY2z\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<em>On <b>weekdays</b>, I get up at 7 and go to school. I have lunch at noon. In the <b>afternoon</b>, I study or meet friends. In the <b>evening</b>, I eat dinner with my family and watch TV.</em>\"}},{\"id\":\"zA3bB4cC5d\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<em>On <b>weekends</b>, I sleep longer. On <b>Saturday</b>, I go shopping. On <b>Sunday</b>, I relax and read a book.</em>\"}},{\"id\":\"dD6eE7fF8g\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Useful connectors:\"}},{\"id\":\"gG9hH0iI1j\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>first</b> — сначала\",\"<b>then / next</b> — затем / потом\",\"<b>after that</b> — после этого\",\"<b>finally</b> — наконец\"]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
